    - target: {fileID: 7116578585119955631, guid: 545c5e76a5e7974439011ae469dcb27c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'At the next market stop, Grandma weighs beans against sweetness while
        an old citrus scent lingers nearby.

        The faded recipe no longer says
        how each flavor should enter.

        She must recover the dessert by remembering
        what comes first, what follows, and what waits until the end.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
